{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":68,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. A Psalm by David. A song."},{"n":1,"text":"Let God arise! Let his enemies be scattered! Let them who hate him also flee before him.","tok":[{"t":"Let God arise! Let "},{"t":"his","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" enemies "},{"t":"be","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" scattered! Let them who hate "},{"t":"him","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"also","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" flee before "},{"t":"him","s":["H1732"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"As smoke is driven away, so drive them away. As wax melts before the fire, so let the wicked perish at the presence of God.","tok":[{"t":"As","s":["H6440"],"a":[5]},{"t":" smoke "},{"t":"is","s":["H6440"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"driven","s":["H5127"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"away","s":["H5127"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"so","s":["H6965"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"drive","s":["H6327"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"them","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"away","s":["H5127"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"As","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" wax melts "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" fire, "},{"t":"so","s":["H6965"]},{"t":" let "},{"t":"the","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" wicked perish "},{"t":"at","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"presence","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" God."}]},{"n":3,"text":"But let the righteous be glad. Let them rejoice before God. Yes, let them rejoice with gladness.","tok":[{"t":"But","s":["H7563"]},{"t":" let "},{"t":"the","s":["H6440"],"a":[3]},{"t":" righteous "},{"t":"be","s":["H7563"]},{"t":" glad. Let "},{"t":"them","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" rejoice "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" God. Yes, let "},{"t":"them","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" rejoice "},{"t":"with","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" gladness."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Sing to God! Sing praises to his name! Extol him who rides on the clouds: to the LORD, his name! Rejoice before him!","tok":[{"t":"Sing "},{"t":"to","s":["H6440"],"a":[10]},{"t":" God! Sing praises "},{"t":"to","s":["H6440"]},{"