},{"t":" word. "},{"t":"The","s":["H3559"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"ones","s":["H2896"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"who","s":["H3427"]},{"t":" proclaim "},{"t":"it","s":["H3559"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"are","s":["H2896"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"great","s":["H2896"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"company","s":["H2416"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"“Kings of armies flee! They flee!” She who waits at home divides the plunder,","tok":[{"t":"“Kings "},{"t":"of","s":["H6635"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"armies","s":["H6635"],"a":[1]},{"t":" flee! "},{"t":"They","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" flee!” She "},{"t":"who","s":["H7227"]},{"t":" waits "},{"t":"at","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" home divides "},{"t":"the","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" plunder,"}]},{"n":13,"text":"while you sleep among the camp fires, the wings of a dove sheathed with silver, her feathers with shining gold.","tok":[{"t":"while","s":["H1004"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"you","s":["H1004"]},{"t":" sleep among "},{"t":"the","s":["H2505"]},{"t":" camp fires, "},{"t":"the","s":["H2505"]},{"t":" wings "},{"t":"of","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" dove sheathed "},{"t":"with","s":["H1004"]},{"t":" silver, her feathers "},{"t":"with","s":["H1004"]},{"t":" shining gold."}]},{"n":14,"text":"When the Almighty scattered kings in her, it snowed on Zalmon.","tok":[{"t":"When","s":["H7901"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H7901"]},{"t":" Almighty scattered kings "},{"t":"in","s":["H7901"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"her","s":["H7901"]},{"t":", it snowed "},{"t":"on","s":["H7901"]},{"t":" Zalmon."}]},{"n":15,"text":"The mountains of Bashan are majestic mountains. The mountains of Bashan are rugged.","tok":[{"t":"The","s":["H6566"]},{"t":" mountains "},{"t":"of","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" Bashan "},{"t":"are","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" majestic mountains. "},{"t":"The","s":["H6566"]},{"t":" mountains "},{"t":"of","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" Bashan "},{"t":"are","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" rugged."}]},{"n":16,"text":"Why do you look in envy, you rugged mountains, at the mountain w